<title>UK: BGB Finance sets 150 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>BGB Finance sets 150 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bank von Ernst &amp; Cie AG Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE (IRELAND) PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.00	MATURITY    30.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBSCRIPTION PERIOD 15.APR.97 - 17.APR.97</p>
<p>		VALOREN NO 608.845</p>
<p> NOTES	LANDESBANK BERLIN GZ AND BERLINER BANK AG ARE ALSO</p>
<p>		GUARANTORS OF THE DEAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
